                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "The single time slot that the shop agreed to, written exactly as it was confirmed (e.g. 'October 10th 2023 12pm to 3pm'). This may be one of the customer's proposed slots OR a slot the shop proposed that you read back and confirmed. Empty string if no slot was confirmed on this call.",
                                        "is_system_provided": false,
